{
  "label": "dojo5",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label dojo5:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Legends have it that centuries ago...a single family ruled over all of Kumon-mi.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Many armies, with the aid of mercenaries and sellswords tried to overthrow this family...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But every attempt amounted to nothing more than senseless bloodshed and a shameful voyage back home...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But one day, after hundreds of years and nearly one thousand fruitless attempts...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The family that had once ruled over Kumon-mi...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Fell.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And from that moment on...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "They were never able to recover.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Until today.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "When one girl begins her conquest...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "To reclaim what is rightfully hers...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Disclaimer: Lessons in Love contains large amounts of information and data that is factually incorrect and no words should be taken as gospel.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate1.webp",
      "alt": "karate1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My name is Ayane Amamiya of the Amamiya family...and I am here to take back what is mine!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate2.webp",
      "alt": "karate2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh please...You really expect me to believe that a child like you aims to take back Kumon-mi?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Woah, where did that huge lens flare come from?!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This territory belongs to the Arakawas now, little girl...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The Amamiyas have had no place here since the...War of...Blood.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate3.webp",
      "alt": "karate3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who are you calling a little girl, you pathetic weakling?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The War of Blood may have ended a long time ago, but the stains it left on these grounds have yet to be forgotten.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you have any idea how many lives have been taken with just these hands alone? Because it's more than you could possibly fathom.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Heed my words, Arakawa. If you have even the slightest desire to survive, you'll-",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate4.webp",
      "alt": "karate4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll what? Walk away from here and give up on Kumon-mi?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ahh! There are even more of them now!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re out of your mind.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have spent the last nine thousand years honing my power and-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate5.webp",
      "alt": "karate5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What?! Nine thousand?!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There is no way that can be right! Can it?!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate4.webp",
      "alt": "karate4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nine thousand years is nothing to me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": After all, I was born with...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That bloodline...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate5.webp",
      "alt": "karate5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What?! That bloodline?!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate6.webp",
      "alt": "karate6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate7.webp",
      "alt": "karate7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": THAT BLOODLINE!!!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate8.webp",
      "alt": "karate8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This can't be...all this time I thought I was the protagonist, but...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If he has that bloodline...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Could this be the end of my journey?...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It can’t be...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not after all I've sacrificed...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve come too far to give up now...there has to be something I can do...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate4.webp",
      "alt": "karate4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s over, Ayane...I have the high ground.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate5.webp",
      "alt": "karate5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’re on the same level! You're just a little taller!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate6.webp",
      "alt": "karate6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But, you see...that’s where you’re wrong...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You and I will never be on the same level...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate4.webp",
      "alt": "karate4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It doesn’t matter how much you train or how many of my underlings you defeat...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is the end of the road. Defeating me isn’t possible...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate9.webp",
      "alt": "karate9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then you leave me no choice...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate10.webp",
      "alt": "karate10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No...It can’t be!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It can!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ve given me no choice but to unleash the Amamiya family’s hidden technique!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Amamiya, for the last time, put that thing away! You’re going to get us shut down!",
      "spk": "Karate Instructor",
      "spkColor": "#9A6BA1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Miss Osaka! Turn the fan speed up! My hair isn't blowing fast enough!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We don't have a-",
      "spk": "Karate Instructor",
      "spkColor": "#9A6BA1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, where did this giant fan even come from?!",
      "spk": "Karate Instructor",
      "spkColor": "#9A6BA1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate11.webp",
      "alt": "karate11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sorry things have to end this way...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You deserve the death of a warrior, not that of a dog.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate12.webp",
      "alt": "karate12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hahahah...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...What's so funny?",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hahahahaha!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait...No...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He can't be...",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate13.webp",
      "alt": "karate13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I can...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ve fallen into my trap, little girl.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You see...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I was born immune to bullets.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate5.webp",
      "alt": "karate5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No! That can’t be!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate7.webp",
      "alt": "karate7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It is!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karate14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karate14.webp",
      "alt": "karate14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The staredown between the two fierce warriors goes on for hours...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Days...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Weeks...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Millennia...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But the sheer respect for one another’s power is enough to force them into exercising more caution than they ever have before.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This was the moment they had lived for...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The moment to finally prove who the rightful ruler of Kumon-mi is!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "How will it end?!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Who will triumph?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Will Ayane Amamiya take back the land her family had all but built with their bare hands?!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Or...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Will the mysterious ronin, clad only in sweatpants and a T-shirt, be able to fend off the legendary Amamiya fighting style?!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Find out next time on Lessons in Love ~ The Battle for Kumon-mi!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene battletwo6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/battletwo6.webp",
      "alt": "battletwo6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This program was brought to you in part by Koi Cafe! Home of the [[copyrighted frozen beverage]!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Long day? Short night? Come to Koi Cafe and try our specialty handcrafted drinks made by adorable girls!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "See you again next time!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Pluuuuus...EXTRA!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karateredux1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karateredux1.webp",
      "alt": "karateredux1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So yeah, that’s basically how you do karate.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you two seriously just going to leave this thing here?! What am I supposed to do about this?!",
      "spk": "Karate Instructor",
      "spkColor": "#9A6BA1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I feel like I actually did pretty well.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, you were surprisingly good. You really had me going with that whole bloodline thing.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thanks. Came up with that off the top of my head. Totally not a play on a mildly obscure video series from 2009.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow, that seems so long ago.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. We’re dying faster than we like to admit.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene karateredux2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/karateredux2.webp",
      "alt": "karateredux2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, you are at least. I’m a perfectly healthy, able-bodied [young_girl] who is going to take back her family’s land through martial arts!",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just remember, you’ll have to defeat me first.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Seriously. What the fuck am I supposed to do about this?",
      "spk": "Karate Instructor",
      "spkColor": "#9A6BA1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Pfft. You make it sound like defeating you is supposed to be a challenge.",
      "spk": "Ayane",
      "spkColor": "#00BAB1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It will be now that you know I’m immune to bullets.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
